  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Interaction.InspectableObject
  inspectionId: Drumsticks
  firstInspection:
  - Two drumsticks, held together with tape. {p}Dani's.
  - 'We were going to start a band. He wrote the name on the tape in silver marker:
    <color=#33FFF2>NIGHT TRAIN</color>.'
  - '* You take them. They still feel like a promise. {p}(You got DANI''S DRUMSTICKS.)'
  repeatInspection:
  - '* The shelf has a clean spot where they used to be.'
  specialInspectionAt: 0
  specialInspection: []
  cycleRepeat: 0
  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 109ddb647902d4ef88b5dfa44fa3a4fc, type: 2}
