  - '* You feel rested. <color=#FFD84F>(HP fully restored.)</color>'
  repeatInspection:
  - '* You lie down again. The ceiling still has glow-in-the-dark stars. {p}<color=#FFD84F>(HP
    fully restored.)</color>'
