  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Subnet.Interaction.InspectableObject
  inspectionId: Kira_Park
  firstInspection:
  - ...
  repeatInspection:
  - Ready when you are. {p}{small}The bag's zipped. I checked twice.{/small}
  - My skates are older than my job. {p}I fixed the left wheel with a hair tie. {p}{bounce}Still
    rolling.{/bounce}
  - You and Byte bicker like brothers. I never had brothers. {p}{small}It's loud.
    I like it.{/small}
  - Do you think the Core has a back door? {p}Couriers always use the back door.
    {p}{small}Nobody looks at you there.{/small}
  - When this is over, let's get food. Real food. {p}{fast}Hot, on a plate, with
    a fork, sitting down, the whole fancy thing.{/fast}
  specialInspectionAt: 0
  specialInspection: []
  cycleRepeat: 1
